THIRD-PARTY MODEL NOTICES (please read — the MIT license above covers this
project's source code only, NOT the AI models it downloads at runtime)

This project downloads the InsightFace `buffalo_l` model pack on first run.
Per upstream InsightFace:

  * The InsightFace source code is MIT licensed.
  * The pre-trained models (including `buffalo_l` and `antelopev2`) and their
    training data are released for NON-COMMERCIAL RESEARCH PURPOSES ONLY.

The pretrained models are not covered by this project's MIT license. Using
MaskIT, or its bundled model, for commercial or revenue-generating purposes
requires a separate commercial license from InsightFace
(https://www.insightface.ai/solutions/face-recognition-licensing).

To use a different, commercially licensed model, point `FaceAnalysis` in
`backend/face_engine.py` at your own model directory.

Other dependencies retain their own licenses (FastAPI, OpenCV, Pillow,
NumPy, ONNX Runtime, and the InsightFace package itself).